  "slug": "firestore-native",
  "name": "Firestore Native",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect and interact with Firestore databases, collections, and documents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `firestore`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install firestore-native@claude-plugins-official` from `gemini-cli-extensions/firestore-native`.\n\nThis repository packages MCP Toolbox's prebuilt `firestore` server as a plugin/extension to interact with Firestore databases. It can be used with various AI agents, including Antigravity, Claude Code and Codex, to manage your databases, collections, and documents using natural language prompts.",
